    {
      "id": "p05",
      "art": "assets/gandhi_s_indigo_truth/img/p05.png",
      "shot": "intimate interior shot inside a peasant hut, Gandhi seated on a low stool as a tenant couple speaks nervously",
      "mood": "calm",
      "lines": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": {
            "en": "He did not start with slogans. He started with listening, as tenants haltingly told him how planters forced indigo on their best land, fined them for refusing, and demanded illegal payments when synthetic dyes ruined the old profits.",
            "hi": "उन्होंने नारे नहीं लगाए, कान लगाए—किरायेदार लड़खड़ाती ज़ुबान से बताते गए कैसे साहब लोग उनकी बेहतरीन जमीन पर जबरन नील बोते, इनकार पर जुर्माना ठोकते, और कृत्रिम रंगों से मुनाफा गिरते ही अवैध वसूली करते।"
          },
