    {
      "id": "p11",
      "art": "assets/gandhi_s_indigo_truth/img/p11.png",
      "shot": "wide shot outside the courthouse as a crowd waits; an official emerges to announce postponement and no immediate sentencing",
      "mood": "suspense",
      "lines": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": {
            "en": "The case hung in the air. Officials hesitated to jail a man who broke the law so openly, yet so politely. They postponed sentence and quietly let him continue his work.",
            "hi": "मुकदमा宙 में अटक गया। अफसर एक ऐसे आदमी को कैद करने से झिझके, जो कानून तोड़ रहा था, पर शिष्टता से। सज़ा टाल दी गई, और चुपचाप उसे काम जारी रखने दिया गया।"
          },
